# Remote players without a relaying server (M6): run with --debug-ghosts 8 --fixed-dt 0.0333.
# The client injects synthetic ENTITY_SPAWN / ENTITY_MOVE / ENTITY_DESPAWN / POSITION_CORRECT
# packets through the same event queue and handlers as network traffic. Kargan character; ghosts
# of both races wander around the plaza (runners, walkers, one that keeps stopping, one that leaves
# and comes back) and get name labels; then a POSITION_CORRECT snaps the player back.
wait 5
waitfor login+idle 120
clickon login.username
text m6_ghosts
clickon login.password
text gizli123
key enter
waitfor charcreate+race+idle 900
clickon create.race.kargan
clickon create.next
waitfor charcreate+details 60
clickon create.class.2
clickon create.face.next
clickon create.name
text Demirhan
clickon create.submit
waitfor charselect+idle+chars1 900
clickon select.enter
waitfor world+ready+idle 1800
waitfor world+remotes8 300
scene camera 200 32 14
wait 60
scene log
screenshot 01_ghosts.png
wait 45
screenshot 02_ghosts_later.png
scene camera 160 18 6
wait 30
screenshot 03_ghosts_close.png
# The leaver (8th ghost) despawns after 7 s and spawns again 3 s later.
waitfor world+remotes7 600
screenshot 04_one_left.png
waitfor world+remotes8 300
scene log
# Run forward a bit, then the "server" corrects the position back by 3 m.
scene camera behind 30 10
keydown w
wait 30
keyup w
wait 5
scene log
scene correct 3
wait 2
screenshot 05_after_correction.png
wait 20
scene log
scene expectwalkable
scene expectgrounded
quit
